CETESB, São Paulo. Manual de Produtos Químicos, revised emergency-response resource and technical guide. [Current guide and substance records](https://produtosquimicos.cetesb.sp.gov.br/Ficha) · [Complete technical guide](https://produtosquimicos.cetesb.sp.gov.br/Content/Guia%20t%C3%A9cnico%20do%20manual.pdf) · [Older catalogue](https://licenciamento.cetesb.sp.gov.br/produtos/produto_consulta.asp).

Read the entire technical guide before interpreting selected product records. Use identifiers, physical/environmental properties, source dates and emergency information alongside the actual supplier documentation; these records are not a substitute for a product-specific safety data sheet.

Checked on 29 October 2026: the revised guide describes a 2016 resource with 96 emergency-response sheets, while the older catalogue describes 879 chemical sheets and earlier revisions. Preserve this version/scope difference rather than presenting both counts as one current collection. Free official access is distinguished from unrestricted reproduction. Automated inspection did not establish every substance record's revision. All references remain external.

